inish for boys and dads without feeling stiff.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Styling pieces not included:</strong> Shorts, sandals, handbags, flowers, and other accessories shown in the photos are styling only and were intentionally excluded from this listing.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose each role and size you need, and build a family matching look that feels calm, polished, and ready for the next sunny memory.</p>","tags":["Beach","Boy Shirt","Button Front Shirt","Child 1-2 Years","Child 2 Years","Child 3 Years","Child 4 Years","Child 5 Years","Child 6-7 Years","Child 8 Years","Child 9-10 Years","Collared Shirt","Daddy and Me","Dress & Shirt","Family Matching","Father 2XL","Father 3XL","Father L","Father M","Father S","Father Shirt","Father XL","Floral","Four-Role Matching","Girl Dress","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1036133456700.html","Long Dress","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family Outfits","Matching Family Set","Matching Family Shirt","Mommy and Me","Mother Dress","Mother L","Mother M","Mother S","Multicolor","Navy","Navy Floral","Navy Red Floral","Red","Red Floral","Resort","Sets","Short Sleeve Shirt","Sleeveless Dress","Small Floral Print","Summer","Summer Family Matching Set","Vacation"],"seo":{"title":"Navy Red Floral Family Set | Dress Like Mommy","description":"Lightweight woven family matching set with navy red floral dresses and shirts for moms, dads, girls & boys. Sizes 1-2Y-10Y, Mother S-L, Father S-3XL."},"category":{"id":"gid://shopify/TaxonomyCategory/aa-1-11","fullName":"Apparel & Accessories > Clothing > Outfit Sets"},"options":[{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOption/9617961386081","name":"Type","position":1,"values":["Dress","Shirt"],"optionValues":[{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOptionValue/6143332122721","name":"Dress","hasVariants":true},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOptionValue/6143331532897","name":"Shirt","hasVariants":true}]},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOption/9617961418849","name":"Size","position":2,"values":["Child 1-2 Years","Child 2 Years","Child 3 Y